[{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07040000_00_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07040000_00_0010","text":"……咦？　怎么了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07040000_00_0020","text":"啊，不用管我——\n我现在有点忙……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07040000_00_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07040000_00_0030","text":"……日用品有几样用完了，\n他说会帮我下单"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07040000_00_0040","text":"啊……！\n能让日花帮忙挑的话，那就放心了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07040000_00_0005","text":"了解，你专心\n忙吧……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07040000_00_0006","text":"我也来帮点什么\n忙吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07040000_00_0007","text":"我还想让你\n帮我挑挑呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07040000_01_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07040000_01_0010","text":"所以说，我在专心忙——\n……嗯，性价比是这个，不过这个和这个也──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07040000_01_0020","text":"嗯\n那，全部都要了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07040000_01_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07040000_02_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07040000_02_0010","text":"哈……？\n那，请您安静一点——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07040000_02_0020","text":"……嗯"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07040000_03_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07040000_03_0010","text":"……\n因为是美琴小姐我才让您帮忙的——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07040000_03_0020","text":"嗯"}]
